msgid "(Just gotta give him the curry now.)"
msgstr "(Solo tengo que darle el curry ahora.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Man in Tights
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "228_Man in Tights"
msgid "Need... curry!"
msgstr "Necesito... curry!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "240_Kiryu"
msgid "(I should really go get him some curry.)"
msgstr "(Realmente debería ir a conseguirle un poco de curry.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "252_Kiryu"
msgid "Hey, curry man! Eat up!"
msgstr "¡Hey, hombre curry! ¡Come!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Man in Tights
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "264_Man in Tights"
msgid "My word...!"
msgstr "¡Mi palabra...!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "276_Man in Tights"
msgid "Mmmmmm, oh yes, yes, yes! I feel it! The pure spice coursing\\r\nthrough my bloodstream! Nay, I have no blood! Only curry!"
msgstr "Mmmmmm, ¡oh sí, sí, sí! ¡Lo siento! ¡La especia pura corriendo\\r \npor mi torrente sanguíneo! ¡No, no tengo sangre! ¡Sólo curry!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "312_Man in Tights"
msgid "Hahaha, at long last, my Curry Energy has reached a boil yet\\r\nagain! Revenge may be sweet, but justice is SPICY!"
msgstr "Jajaja, ¡por fin, mi Curry Energy ha vuelto a hervir!\\r\n¡La venganza puede ser dulce, pero la justicia es picante!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Macho Punk
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=9
msgctxt "348_Macho Punk"
msgid "What the shit!? Where's he gettin' all that energy from!?"
msgstr "¿Qué mierda!? ¿De dónde obtiene toda esa energía!?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Man in Tights
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "360_Man in Tights"
msgid "Avast, evildoers!"
msgstr "¡Alto, Malhechores!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Young Punk
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=12
msgctxt "372_Young Punk"
msgid "Shit, shit, shit!"
msgstr "¡Mierda, mierda, mierda!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Purple-suited Punk
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=14
msgctxt "384_Purple-suited Punk"
msgid "No backin' down! Get him!"
msgstr "¡Sin marcha atrás! ¡por él!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Macho Punk
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=9
msgctxt "408_Macho Punk"
msgid "Hrgh!"
msgstr "¡Hrgh!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Purple-suited Punk
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=14
msgctxt "420_Purple-suited Punk"
msgid "Ack!"
msgstr "¡Ay!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=Young Punk
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=12
msgctxt "432_Young Punk"
msgid "Owww!"
msgstr "¡Awww!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Macho Punk
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=9
msgctxt "480_Macho Punk"
msgid "How... is he... so strong?"
msgstr "¿Cómo... es... tan fuerte?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Man in Tights
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "492_Man in Tights"
msgid "Mission complete!"
msgstr "¡Misión completada!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=30
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P30
#. y4:msg_speaker=Man in Tights
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "564_Man in Tights"
msgid "I really must thank you, my saint of spice."
msgstr "De verdad debo darte las gracias, mi santo de las especias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=31
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P31
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "576_Kiryu"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr "No hay de que."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "588_Man in Tights"
msgid "I always assumed I was lone protector of this city, but it\\r\nappears I'm not the only chunk of beef in this curry pot."
msgstr "Siempre supuse que yo era el protector solitario de esta ciudad, pero\\r \nparece que no soy el único trozo de carne en esta olla de curry."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "600_Man in Tights"
msgid "To think there was another like me... Haha! I'll have to\\r\nredouble my efforts!"
msgstr "Y pensar que había otro como yo... ¡Jaja! ¡Tendré que\\r\nredoblar mis esfuerzos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "612_Man in Tights"
msgid "Or perhaps we could team up? I can see it now! Me, the Curry\\r\nCrusader. You, the Katsu Kid! A match made in the bubbling\\r\nbrown expanse of curry heaven!"
msgstr "¿O tal vez podríamos formar un equipo? ¡Ya me lo imagino! Yo, el Cruzado del Curry.\\r \nTú, ¡el Chico Katsu! ¡Una dupla hecha en la burbujeante\\r \nextensión marrón del paraíso del curry!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=35
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P35
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "624_Kiryu"
msgid "...I think I'll pass. I don't know if I have the appetite for crime-fighting."
msgstr "...creo que pasaré. No sé si tengo el apetito para luchar contra el crimen."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=36
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P36
#. y4:msg_speaker=Man in Tights
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "636_Man in Tights"
msgid "I see. Most unfortunate, but very well."
msgstr "Ya veo. Muy desafortunado, pero muy bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "648_Man in Tights"
msgid "Nonetheless, allow me to thank you. Please accept this. And\\r\nbefore you decline, I won't take no for an answer."
msgstr "Sin embargo, déjame darte las gracias. Por favor, acepta esto. Y\\r\nantes de que lo rechaces, No tomaré un no por respuesta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=41
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P41
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "696_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, if you insist."
msgstr "Je, si tú insistes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=42
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P42
#. y4:msg_speaker=Man in Tights
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "708_Man in Tights"
msgid "Someday we shall meet again! Until then, BE SPICY!"
msgstr "¡Algún día nos volveremos a encontrar! Hasta entonces, ¡SÉ PICANTE!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=44
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P44
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "732_Kiryu"
msgid "(Now that I think about it, I could really go for some Matsuya curry...)"
msgstr "(Ahora que lo pienso, me apetece un poco de curry Matsuya...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=decision
#. y4:msg_label=Pregunta con opciones
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
